  recipeName: White Russian
  cocktailIcon: {fileID: 0}
  cocktailStory: The White Russian developed from the earlier Black Russian, which
    was created in Brussels in 1949 by bartender Gustave Tops. The original drink
    combined vodka with coffee liqueur, while the White Russian later became known
    for the addition of cream. Despite its name, the cocktail was not created in
    Russia.
